    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Organization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Members of organizations are either Organizations themselves or individual Persons. Members can bear specific Organization Member Roles that are determined in the organization rules. The organization rules also determine how decisions are made on behalf of the Organization by the organization members.</rdfs:comment>
