    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Flow Chemistry</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A continuous flow is a chemical reaction that runs in a continuous flowing stream rather than in batch production. [Wikipedia]</skos:definition>
