    <skos:altLabel> </skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A waste coolant is a coolant from an output of a process, which can not be used anymore. It is assumed that the quantity of the waste coolant has the same amount as the coolant input in the same process.</skos:definition>
